anced repeated replication weights were constructed to account for the complex survey design and to adjust for nonresponse.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"inferential comparisons were made using Rao-Scott design-adjusted chi-square testing\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses were conducted overall and stratified by agency type\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"All estimates are significant at p<0.001.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}